+# API Specialist Review: KAN-29 (KB-P3-AUDIT-23)
+
+- Ticket: KAN-29
+- Title: [KB-P3-AUDIT-23] Add 12-Color Palette + Advanced Color Picker and Pre-Delete Reverse-Audit & Safe Migration for Workflow States & Labels (4 Problems)
