+## 4. Test Coverage Audit
+
+- Pytest Backend Suites:
+  - 65 passed in 15.59s across `kanban/tests/realtime/`, `test_realtime_outbox.py`, and `test_p4_22_outbox_replay_reader_migration.py`.
