+-   - Styled `.kb-passkey-clone-warning` using high-contrast danger tokens `var(--bg-danger-subtle)` and `var(--text-danger)` for the `⚠️ Suspected Clone` badge, verified in `live-kan25-clone-warning-desktop-light.png`.
